cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or this code, please cite both the article (preferred-citation) and this repository."
type: software
title: "Data and code for: The hidden links between animal weapons, fighting style, and their effect on contest success - a meta-analysis"
abstract: "Data and code for a phylogenetic meta-analysis of how animal weapons influence contest success, and for the individual-based simulation that underpins its effect-size rationale. Contains 173 effect sizes from 49 studies and 52 species, the shared-control correlation matrices used in the multilevel models, the metafor analysis script, the forest-plot code and the simulation model."
